<html>
<head>
<meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=iso-8859-1"></head>
<style>p{margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;}</style>
<body class="setupTab" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:b1st1; bLabel:body;">
<center>
<table cellpadding="0" width="500" cellspacing="0" id="topTable" height="450"><tr valign="top" style=" display:none;">
<td style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r1st1; bLabel:header; vertical-align:top; height:0; text-align:left;"></td></tr><tr valign="top" style=" display:none;"><td style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r2st1; bLabel:accent1; height:0;"></td>
</tr><tr valign="top"><td styleInsert="1" height="300" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tr valign="top" height="400">
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0"><font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Hello,&nbsp;</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Your account is past due by {!IF (AND(Case.Originating_Lender_formula__c="Quick Bridge Funding", Case.Payment_Frequency__c="Weekly"), (Case.Payments_Behind__c/5),Case.Payments_Behind__c)} payments. Are you in the position to get any of these caught up at this time</span><span style="font-size: 12pt;">?</span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">We can run as a lump sum or split these up if needed and run them on days of your choice. Please let me know.&nbsp;</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Note: Please respond directly to this email and do not remove any of the contents. Any payment ran past date of maturity carries an additional $10 per day fee. **Fee will be waived if your modification was due to the hurricanes**</font></p></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Thank you,&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Case_Email_Signature_Name_Formula__c}<font style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;"></font></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial"><b>{!Case.Originating_Lender_formula__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c},</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">P: {!Case.OwnerPhone}&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium;"></span></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="" size="1">{!Case.Email_Thread_ID__c}</font></div></div></div></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr valign="top" style=" display:none;"><td style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r4st1; bLabel:accent2; height:0;"></td></tr><tr valign="top" style=" display:none;"><td style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r5st1; bLabel:footer; vertical-align:top; height:0; text-align:left;"></td></tr><tr valign="top" style=" display:none;"><td style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r6st1; bLabel:accent3; height:0;"></td></tr></table></center></body></html>